			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775088486700,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "A Flink job starts with a StreamExecutionEnvironment and typically involves defining your source, your transformations, and your sink:\n",
			"rawText": "A Flink job starts with a StreamExecutionEnvironment and typically involves defining your source, your transformations, and your sink:\n",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "A Flink job starts with a StreamExecutionEnvironment and typically involves defining your source, your transformations, and your sink:\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "SgcvLxFB",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -1264.347580989001,
			"y": -1127.5923318187045,
			"width": 680.495361328125,
			"height": 360,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b0E",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1062804022,
			"version": 411,
			"versionNonce": 401981162,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775088486700,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "StreamExecutionEnvironment env = StreamExecutionEnvironment.getExecutionEnvironment();\n\n// Define source (e.g., Kafka)\nDataStream<ClickEvent> clicks = env\n    .addSource(new FlinkKafkaConsumer<>(\"clicks\", new ClickEventSchema(), properties));\n\n// Define transformations\nDataStream<WindowedClicks> windowedClicks = clicks\n    .keyBy(event -> event.getUserId())\n    .window(TumblingEventTimeWindows.of(Time.minutes(5)))\n    .aggregate(new ClickAggregator());\n\n// Define sink (e.g., Elasticsearch)\nwindowedClicks\n    .addSink(new ElasticsearchSink.Builder<>(elasticsearchConfig).build());\n\n// Execute\nenv.execute(\"Click Processing Job\");",
			"rawText": "StreamExecutionEnvironment env = StreamExecutionEnvironment.getExecutionEnvironment();\n\n// Define source (e.g., Kafka)\nDataStream<ClickEvent> clicks = env\n    .addSource(new FlinkKafkaConsumer<>(\"clicks\", new ClickEventSchema(), properties));\n\n// Define transformations\nDataStream<WindowedClicks> windowedClicks = clicks\n    .keyBy(event -> event.getUserId())\n    .window(TumblingEventTimeWindows.of(Time.minutes(5)))\n    .aggregate(new ClickAggregator());\n\n// Define sink (e.g., Elasticsearch)\nwindowedClicks\n    .addSink(new ElasticsearchSink.Builder<>(elasticsearchConfig).build());\n\n// Execute\nenv.execute(\"Click Processing Job\");",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "StreamExecutionEnvironment env = StreamExecutionEnvironment.getExecutionEnvironment();\n\n// Define source (e.g., Kafka)\nDataStream<ClickEvent> clicks = env\n    .addSource(new FlinkKafkaConsumer<>(\"clicks\", new ClickEventSchema(), properties));\n\n// Define transformations\nDataStream<WindowedClicks> windowedClicks = clicks\n    .keyBy(event -> event.getUserId())\n    .window(TumblingEventTimeWindows.of(Time.minutes(5)))\n    .aggregate(new ClickAggregator());\n\n// Define sink (e.g., Elasticsearch)\nwindowedClicks\n    .addSink(new ElasticsearchSink.Builder<>(elasticsearchConfig).build());\n\n// Execute\nenv.execute(\"Click Processing Job\");",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "6e9a9ts7",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -1268.1821070167114,
			"y": -711.8292633713465,
			"width": 1212.3801631932824,
			"height": 80,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b0F",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 887382902,
			"version": 229,
			"versionNonce": 1517911222,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775088486700,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "The code here should be very readable with the aforementioned concepts in mind. We're defining a source, a series of transformations (operators), and a\nsink. The source is a Kafka topic that we're reading from. The transformations are a series of operators that we're applying to the data. The sink is a\nElasticsearch cluster that we're writing the results to.\n",
			"rawText": "The code here should be very readable with the aforementioned concepts in mind. We're defining a source, a series of transformations (operators), and a sink. The source is a Kafka topic that we're reading from. The transformations are a series of operators that we're applying to the data. The sink is a Elasticsearch cluster that we're writing the results to.\n",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "The code here should be very readable with the aforementioned concepts in mind. We're defining a source, a series of transformations (operators), and a sink. The source is a Kafka topic that we're reading from. The transformations are a series of operators that we're applying to the data. The sink is a Elasticsearch cluster that we're writing the results to.\n",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
